        "authored_by": "hand-seeded",
        "via": "fixed-lab-quirk",
        "note": "rival battle triggers on EXIT (OaksLab door script), not on interacting the rival; battle auto-handled by policy. The fight is ~coin-flip RNG at L5 and a LOSS is survivable in gen1 \u2014 the plan is LOSS-TOLERANT by design: flag-only done_when, the train_to_l12 grind absorbs the level deficit, when-guards keep downstream macros from misfiring off the loss trajectory"
